{"5134300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cubeidle - Incremental Cube Breaker", "steam_appid": 5134300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break the cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cube sits in front of you, ranging from 1,000 to 1,000,000,000,000 voxels. Break it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Click the cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with breaking single voxels, earn ore which you can upgrade your clicks into larger blasts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drill the cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use drills to automate the cube breaking process, upgrade their speed, radius or quantity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beat the cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each cube, the next gets exponentially larger. Unlock prestige upgrades to take with you to the next cube.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break the cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cube sits in front of you, ranging from 1,000 to 1,000,000,000,000 voxels. Break it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Click the cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with breaking single voxels, earn ore which you can upgrade your clicks into larger blasts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drill the cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use drills to automate the cube breaking process, upgrade their speed, radius or quantity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beat the cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each cube, the next gets exponentially larger. Unlock prestige upgrades to take with you to the next cube.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A 3D incremental miner. Excavate a solid cube of up to ONE TRILLION voxels by hand and by drill, spend the haul on upgrades, then prestige into a bigger cube.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5